# The build context holds only what the image needs (see Dockerfile): everything is
# left out, then the app files are let back in. Never .venv, models/ (symlinks), tests,
# docs, .git or scratch files.
*
!backend/
!web/
!data/quran/
!scripts/download_models.sh
!scripts/space_start.sh
!requirements.lock
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[co]
**/.*
**/*~
